:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Serum (Rare Cat)]].''
'''Serum''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Serum
|image = E 093.png
|appearance = [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 720¢ - 2844¢
}}

==Enemy==
Serum is a lot stronger than the other Merc Storia enemies you've faced, especially at high buffs. She moves very quickly (as fast as [[Squire Rel]]), attacks almost as quick as [[Norn (Enemy)|Norn]], and has nearly thrice [[Yoichi (Enemy)|Yoichi's]] HP. She also has only 1 knockback, which allows her to be a great meatshield for the enemies.

==Strategy==
She has one slight disadvantage, being [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]], allowing you to use [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating units]] to wear her down.

